        <p>干货 A · 元技能 — 消融实验导读</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="96" width="840" height="58">
      <content textType="headline" color="rgb(28,58,74)" bold="true">
        <p>怎么读一张“消融表”？（读懂了就不只是报数字）</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="64" startY="164" endX="896" endY="164">
      <border color="rgb(213,224,229)" width="2"/>
    </line>

    <!-- 左列：读消融三步法 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="182" width="430" height="86" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(246,250,247)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(218,231,221)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="76" topLeftY="190" width="400" height="26">
      <content textType="caption" bold="true" color="rgb(69,122,92)">
        <p>第 1 步 · 看“零件”有哪些</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="76" topLeftY="218" width="398" height="44">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(60,80,92)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3">
        <p>消融对象 = 方法里可拆卸的组件（模块/损失/网络件）。先圈出作者拆了谁。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="280" width="430" height="86" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(246,250,247)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(218,231,221)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="76" topLeftY="288" width="400" height="26">
      <content textType="caption" bold="true" color="rgb(69,122,92)">
        <p>第 2 步 · 看“拆掉谁掉分最多”</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="76" topLeftY="316" width="398" height="44">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(60,80,92)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3">
        <p>去掉某件后性能回落到哪：掉回/接近“基线”= 最不可替代 = 最关键。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="378" width="430" height="104" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(236,246,238)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(203,227,209)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="76" topLeftY="386" width="400" height="26">
      <content textType="caption" bold="true" color="rgb(69,122,92)">
        <p>第 3 步 · 定位主贡献 + 警惕注水</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="76" topLeftY="416" width="400" height="58">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(60,80,92)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3">
        <p>①哪个模块贡献最大、②谁只是锦上添花、③有没有报“去掉却不掉分”的可疑组件。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 右列：对到 M3GCD -->
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="180" width="400" height="28">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(28,58,74)">
        <p>套回 M3GCD：逐模块摘除来验贡献</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- DEF 行 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="216" width="392" height="66" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(202,218,221)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="216" width="6" height="66">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(13,108,112)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(13,108,112)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="536" topLeftY="226" width="360" height="26">
      <content textType="caption" bold="true" color="rgb(13,108,112)">
        <p>摘掉 DEF → 动态图文融合失效</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="536" topLeftY="250" width="360" height="26">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(60,80,92)">
        <p>退回固定权重 → 检验“动态分配”是否真有用</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- LEB 行 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="292" width="392" height="66" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(202,218,221)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="292" width="6" height="66">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(88,124,160)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(88,124,160)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="536" topLeftY="302" width="360" height="26">
      <content textType="caption" bold="true" color="rgb(88,124,160)">
        <p>摘掉 LEB → 局部可靠度再平衡关闭</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="536" topLeftY="326" width="360" height="26">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(60,80,92)">
        <p>验证“无标签下仲裁”对少数派模态是否必要</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- CD 行 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="368" width="392" height="66" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(202,218,221)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="368" width="6" height="66">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(224,150,28)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(224,150,28)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="536" topLeftY="378" width="360" height="26">
      <content textType="caption" bold="true" color="rgb(150,100,20)">
        <p>摘掉 CD → 固定/预置类别数 K</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="536" topLeftY="402" width="360" height="26">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(60,80,92)">
        <p>检验“自动长出新类”相比固定 K 的真增益</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 底线判断条 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="450" width="392" height="62" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(251,244,232)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(226,205,168)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="538" topLeftY="458" width="356" height="48">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(130,92,32)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3">
        <p><strong>主持人要会讲：</strong>哪一块摘掉回落到基线，那块就握着主要增益——这是消融表格的“价值排序”。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
  </data>
  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>页7 · 干货A（元技能）：给导师的信号=我不仅知道作者报了个结果，还知道这套方法论该怎么读。口诀：拆零件→看谁摘掉掉分多→谁掉回基线谁最关键；对 M3GCD 即逐块摘 DEF / LEB / CD，比较“去掉后是否回落、回落多大”，从而把三模块按贡献排个序，而不是三块平均用力。讲完可抛问题：作者有没有承认某模块被摘掉不掉分？</p>
    </content>
  </note>
</slide>
